<title>UK: Brent Walker has interim loss again, no div.</title>
<headline>Brent Walker has interim loss again, no div.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ending June 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		13.0 loss	    vs 13.7 loss</p>
<p> Pretax		     51.6 loss	    vs 51.4 loss</p>
<p> Turnover		   852.6		  vs 861.9</p>
<p>Note - The Brent Walker Group Plc said it would not pay an interim dividend.  </p>
<p> Operating result	 32.9		   vs 24.9</p>
<p> Interest		   85.1 payable	 vs 74.3 payable</p>
<p> Tax			  nil		    vs nil</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 5427717</p>
